  "findings": [
    "Only two local cast starts occur after Selfless effect addition and before its first removal/boundary: Seed of Life2105 targeted at actor28, and untargeted Volfen Blessing2379.",
    "Seed of Life has modern162/kind62 float-0.04 immediately before start; Volfen Blessing has kind62 float approximately-0.1369863.",
    "Existing original-client timing proof classifies kind62 as cast timing override, not an Energy debit. Neither value can be converted into paid Energy.",
    "No modern162/property33 current-Energy receipt or modern156/157/158 curve candidate occurs in the four active intervals.",
    "Seed target28 differs from caster25, but raw actor IDs alone do not prove ally/player classification. Untargeted Volfen form does not test an ally spell discount.",
    "Prior modifier cast receipts are contextual history only; they do not establish active glyph charges or Quickening Zephyr spirit ownership/range."
  ],
  "ordering_limits": [
    "No detectable paid-Energy debit establishes the Selfless discount even in the targeted Seed example.",
    "No controlled paired casts with independent base cost, allegiance rank, resource capacity and modifier state exist in these windows.",
    "Quickening Zephyr versus Selfless ordering, glyph/Lesser Energy versus Selfless ordering, integer rounding and minimum-cost behavior are not distinguishable.",
    "Absence is scoped to decoded packet forms and these windows; unrelated incomplete packets and omitted capture fields prevent a universal no-cost assertion.",
    "No client or shared runtime edits; report uses only the frozen checkpoint and existing offline timing classification."
